                "text": "\u201cHospital at Home\u201d programs deliver safe, efficient care to Medicare patients directly in their homes.\n\nThis afternoon, I look forward to @HouseGOP passing my Hospital Inpatient Services Modernization Act to expand this life-changing care model.\n\nHere are the benefits of H&H \ud83e\uddf5 https://t.co/NgffLyu9bS",
