                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "\u201cHospital at Home\u201d programs allow patients to recover in their own homes. This produces cost savings for the Medicare program:\n\n\ud83d\udcb0 Cuts costs associated with traditional hospital stays\n\ud83d\udecf\ufe0f Helps avoid shortages of hospital beds\n\nSome pilots have achieved savings of 30% or more!",
